On 15/03/2024, 3:21=E2=80=AFPM, "Faye Simpson" <faye.simpson@afpbloom.com> wrote:

=20

Dear Nadia,=20

=20

I hope you are well.

=20

Please find attached further final hearing notes, as requested.=20

=20

Under the letter of instruction of 22 September 2023, which you signed as p=
art of your Detach loan (attached for ease), we were instructed to:

=20

=E2=80=98D.  Use all reasonable endeavours to ensure that repayment of all sums u=
nder the loan agreement(s) with Detach Lending are provided for within the t=
erms of any court order made in respect of my legal proceedings to included =
where applicable the order to place a registered charge against assets.=20

=20

E. Receive the proceeds of the Proceedings (and the disposal proceeds that =
I am entitled to in relation to my properties (if any) into your client acco=
unt and use such proceeds to settle all outstanding sums under the Loan Agre=
ement(s), where required also provide the conveyancing solicitor with these =
instructions     including the Schedule 1 notice (Deed of Assignment)=E2=80=99=20

=20

Similarly, we made certain agreements with Gateley legal in relation to the=
 judgment and final order =E2=80=93 please see the correspondence attached.=20

=20

We will therefore need to update Detach and Gateley Legal that you are now =
acting in person.=20

=20

Please see a below drafts for your review. Please let us know if you are ha=
ppy for these to be sent.=20

=20

Separately, did you hear anything back from Karim=E2=80=99s solicitors in relatio=
n to Oxus?=20

=20

DRAFT TO DETACH

=20

Dear Hannah,=20

=20

We write in relation to Nadia Zahmoul.=20

=20

In terms of update, the final hearing finished on 28 February, with judgmen=
